# detail
Number of changes: 1

1. Modified | Class definition
   Replaced the entire `FigureCanvasQTAggBase` class: the original class inherited from `FigureCanvasAgg` and contained multiple methods and attribute-initialization logic; the new class adds the `@cbook.deprecated("2.2")` decorator, inherits from `FigureCanvasQTAgg`, and contains only `pass`.
   The original implementation included:

   * Constructor: initialize Qt attributes, drawing state, the bounding-box queue, and the drawing rectangle;
   * Property: define the deprecated `blitbox` property;
   * Instance methods: define `drawRectangle`, `paintEvent`, `draw`, `draw_idle`, `__draw_idle_agg`, `blit`, and `print_figure`.

   The new implementation includes:

   * Class decorator: add `@cbook.deprecated("2.2")`;
   * Class inheritance: change the base class from `FigureCanvasAgg` to `FigureCanvasQTAgg`;
   * Class-body statement: use `pass`.
# /detail
